{"id": "6aadca6080ac9402dd831831e1accbb1", "text": "Answer 1 : Inert nature is under the control of the Lord Almighty. The \nLord gives physical bodies comprised of material nature to Vasudeva and \nDevaki and ent ers their bodies in His transcendental form and manifests \nHimself.  \nQuestion 2 : What makes some think of the Lord as having a birth like \neveryone else?  \nAnswer 2 : The Lord causes ignorance in some through Goddess Durga \nwho acts under His control.  \nQuestion 3 : What benefit does the Lord get by manifesting Himself", "embedding": [-0.005406125448644161, 0.011271548457443714, 0.03946241736412048, 0.0862744003534317, 0.06256662309169769, -0.03341693803668022, 0.13933274149894714, 0.0026118720415979624, -0.036409132182598114, 0.06417140364646912, 0.04102649539709091, -0.10268911719322205, -0.054622750729322433, -0.07009696960449219, 0.04824573174118996, 0.003929276019334793, -0.016265753656625748, -0.05197937786579132, -0.029764574021100998, 0.03701897710561752, 0.006750032305717468, -0.019634472206234932, -0.017559656873345375, -0.012475192546844482, -0.034670669585466385, -0.017858613282442093, -0.031877558678388596, 0.0001668978075031191, 0.03466907888650894, -0.09320492297410965, 0.009896909818053246, -0.0056983050890266895, -0.024223260581493378, 0.01867375709116459, -0.13750198483467102, 0.11864754557609558, 0.06919043511152267, 0.036140866577625275, -0.05169719457626343, -0.09782417863607407, 0.013040420599281788, -0.06922604143619537, -0.05528603494167328, 0.01968659833073616, 0.06249050796031952, -0.016030646860599518, -0.06607524305582047, -0.002126669976860285, 0.01759403757750988, -0.054069723933935165, -0.07639352232217789, -0.030955813825130463, 0.007351929321885109, 0.02169325388967991, -0.061630893498659134, -0.030317509546875954, 0.02183491922914982, 0.060904212296009064, 0.028552016243338585, -0.09579340368509293, 0.06637141853570938, 0.007232787553220987, 0.032017506659030914, 0.035346683114767075, 0.06302351504564285, -0.076380